<?xml version="1.0"?>
<config xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
        xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="urn:magento:module:Magento_Config:etc/system_file.xsd">
    <system>
        <section id="yu_aisearchengine" translate="label" sortOrder="50" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
            <label>Search Engine AI</label>
            <tab>yu_ai</tab>
            <resource>Yu_AiSearchEngine::config</resource>
            <group id="semantic" translate="label" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                <label>Semantic Search</label>
                <field id="enabled" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1">
                    <label>Enabled</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>Blends keyword search with meaning-based (vector) search using OpenAI embeddings, configured under LLM AI. Turn on only after the "AI Search Vector" indexer (Index Management) has completed at least one full reindex - until then the vector index does not exist and every request silently falls back to keyword-only.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="keyword_weight" translate="label comment" type="text" sortOrder="20" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1">
                    <label>Keyword Score Weight</label>
                    <comment>0-1. Each score is normalized to [0,1] independently before blending, so the two weights are not required to sum to 1. Default 0.4.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="vector_weight" translate="label comment" type="text" sortOrder="30" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1">
                    <label>Vector Score Weight</label>
                    <comment>0-1. See Keyword Score Weight. Default 0.6.</comment>
                </field>
            </group>
        </section>
    </system>
</config>
